{"id":"cef4708b7fffcfcb","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc.md","title":"EU 与 EB 的有限路径刻画","display":"thm-ctl-until-before-tc — EU 与 EB 的有限路径刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc","aliases":["29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc"],"display":"thm-ctl-until-before-tc — EU 与 EB 的有限路径刻画","depends_on":["[[29-df-kripke-structure]]","[[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]","[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]","[[29-df-ctl-fragment]]","[[29-df-tc]]"],"source_locator":"Definition14.28, p.236, scan251; proof of Theorem14.29, p.238, scan253","source_basis":"用户 DjVu 文本层及扫描251、253原图；下列关系级公式与有限图证明逐项本地核对"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ctl-until-before-tc — EU 与 EB 的有限路径刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8cb839e87a64afa7\" href=\"?note=8cb839e87a64afa7\" title=\"29-df-kripke-structure\">29-df-kripke-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e74e9bfdebb2e9eb\" href=\"?note=e74e9bfdebb2e9eb\" title=\"29-df-ctl-star-syntax\">29-df-ctl-star-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76daeadc9ac4f409\" href=\"?note=76daeadc9ac4f409\" title=\"29-df-ctl-star-semantics\">29-df-ctl-star-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f0b39f920854da20\" href=\"?note=f0b39f920854da20\" title=\"29-df-ctl-fragment\">29-df-ctl-fragment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e0bc79e14d83be0f\" href=\"?note=e0bc79e14d83be0f\" title=\"29-df-tc\">29-df-tc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition14.28, p.236, scan251; proof of Theorem14.29, p.238, scan253"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户 DjVu 文本层及扫描251、253原图；下列关系级公式与有限图证明逐项本地核对"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i&lt;k})\">\\(K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i&lt;k})\\)</span> 为非空有限 Kripke 结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in S\">\\(s\\in S\\)</span>；路径及真值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_s^K,V_p^K\">\\(V_s^K,V_p^K\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8cb839e87a64afa7\" href=\"?note=8cb839e87a64afa7\" title=\"29-df-kripke-structure\">29-df-kripke-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"76daeadc9ac4f409\" href=\"?note=76daeadc9ac4f409\" title=\"29-df-ctl-star-semantics\">29-df-ctl-star-semantics</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathsf S_k\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathsf S_k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K)\">\\(\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf B\">\\(\\mathsf B\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f0b39f920854da20\" href=\"?note=f0b39f920854da20\" title=\"29-df-ctl-fragment\">29-df-ctl-fragment</a> 的派生路径构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TC}_S\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e0bc79e14d83be0f\" href=\"?note=e0bc79e14d83be0f\" title=\"29-df-tc\">29-df-tc</a> 的反身传递闭包。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_a^K,P_b^K,M_a^K,M_b^K\">\\(P_a^K,P_b^K,M_a^K,M_b^K\\)</span> 在下式定义；这些是关系级真值集合，未假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 为一阶公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_h^K\\coloneqq\\{u\\in S\\mid V_s^K(h,u)=1\\},\\qquad M_h^K\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in R\\mid u\\in P_h^K\\}\\qquad(h\\in\\{a,b\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_h^K\\coloneqq\\{u\\in S\\mid V_s^K(h,u)=1\\},\\qquad M_h^K\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in R\\mid u\\in P_h^K\\}\\qquad(h\\in\\{a,b\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_p^K(\\mathsf B(\\iota a,\\iota b),\\rho)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(V_s^K(b,\\rho(i))=0\\to\\exists j&lt;i\\;V_s^K(a,\\rho(j))=1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_p^K(\\mathsf B(\\iota a,\\iota b),\\rho)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(V_s^K(b,\\rho(i))=0\\to\\exists j&lt;i\\;V_s^K(a,\\rho(j))=1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_s^K(\\mathsf E\\mathsf U(\\iota a,\\iota b),s)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\in S\\;((s,t)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(M_a^K)\\land t\\in P_b^K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_s^K(\\mathsf E\\mathsf U(\\iota a,\\iota b),s)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\in S\\;((s,t)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(M_a^K)\\land t\\in P_b^K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_s^K(\\mathsf E\\mathsf B(\\iota a,\\iota b),s)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\in S\\;\\left((s,t)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(M_b^K)\\land\\left(t\\in P_a^K\\cap P_b^K\\lor\\exists u\\in S\\;((t,u)\\in M_b^K\\land(u,t)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(M_b^K))\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_s^K(\\mathsf E\\mathsf B(\\iota a,\\iota b),s)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\in S\\;\\left((s,t)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(M_b^K)\\land\\left(t\\in P_a^K\\cap P_b^K\\lor\\exists u\\in S\\;((t,u)\\in M_b^K\\land(u,t)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(M_b^K))\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源分层：原书 Definition14.28 给 B 的逐位置语义；Theorem14.29 的证明给 EU、EB 的 TC 翻译。本条把证明中的一阶求值子公式替换为明确的关系级集合，并展开严格 TC 所要求的实际边。来源陈述及所列证明段已读；以下是该重建的本地论证。</p>\n<p>B 的首式直接展开 ¬(¬a U ¬b)。EU：在 until 见证 t 之前的每条边，其源点满足 a；到达 t 后可继续为无限路径，因为每个状态有后继。反向取有限可达前缀即可；空前缀恰好处理当前状态已满足 b 的情况。</p>\n<p>EB：若存在一直满足 b 的路径，有限性产生可达非空环，得到右式第二分支。否则取路径上第一次 b 失败的位置 i；B 提供某个 j&lt;i 的 a 见证，前缀的每个状态以及 j 处仍满足 b，得到第一分支。反向，第一分支允许先沿 b 前缀走到 a∧b，此后任意延长；将来每次 b 失败，都已有更早的 a。第二分支允许到达并无限重复一个全部源点满足 b 的实际环。自环也可作非空环，而单独的 TC 对角线不能代替该环。总后继性用于有限前缀延长；有限性只在从无限 b 路径提取环时使用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-kripke-structure","status":"resolved","id":"8cb839e87a64afa7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-kripke-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-star-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"e74e9bfdebb2e9eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-star-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"76daeadc9ac4f409","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"f0b39f920854da20","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-fragment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-tc","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc79e14d83be0f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-tc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-kripke-structure","status":"resolved","id":"8cb839e87a64afa7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i<k})$ 为非空有限 Kripke 结构，$s\\in S$；路径及真值 $V_s^K,V_p^K$ 见 [[29-df-kripke-structure]]、[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-star-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"76daeadc9ac4f409","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i<k})$ 为非空有限 Kripke 结构，$s\\in S$；路径及真值 $V_s^K,V_p^K$ 见 [[29-df-kripke-structure]]、[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"f0b39f920854da20","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a,b\\in\\mathsf S_k$；$\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K)$；$\\mathsf B$ 是 [[29-df-ctl-fragment]] 的派生路径构造。$\\operatorname{TC}_S$ 为 [[29-df-tc]] 的反身传递闭包。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-tc","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc79e14d83be0f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a,b\\in\\mathsf S_k$；$\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K)$；$\\mathsf B$ 是 [[29-df-ctl-fragment]] 的派生路径构造。$\\operatorname{TC}_S$ 为 [[29-df-tc]] 的反身传递闭包。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i<k})","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"V_s^K,V_p^K","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathsf S_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TC}_S","display":false},{"tex":"P_a^K,P_b^K,M_a^K,M_b^K","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"P_h^K\\coloneqq\\{u\\in S\\mid V_s^K(h,u)=1\\},\\qquad M_h^K\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in R\\mid u\\in P_h^K\\}\\qquad(h\\in\\{a,b\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"V_p^K(\\mathsf B(\\iota a,\\iota b),\\rho)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;(V_s^K(b,\\rho(i))=0\\to\\exists j<i\\;V_s^K(a,\\rho(j))=1).","display":true},{"tex":"V_s^K(\\mathsf E\\mathsf U(\\iota a,\\iota b),s)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\in S\\;((s,t)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(M_a^K)\\land t\\in P_b^K).","display":true},{"tex":"V_s^K(\\mathsf E\\mathsf B(\\iota a,\\iota b),s)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\in S\\;\\left((s,t)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(M_b^K)\\land\\left(t\\in P_a^K\\cap P_b^K\\lor\\exists u\\in S\\;((t,u)\\in M_b^K\\land(u,t)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(M_b^K))\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":3038,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc]]、[[29-df-ctl-tc-translation]]、[[29-thm-ctl-fo2-tc]] — EU/EB 的路径与环刻画、显式两变量翻译及正确性"},{"id":"d5d29e8c675bca09","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc]]"},{"id":"08f453008a616925","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc|29-thm-ctl-until-before-tc]]"}],"outgoing":["8cb839e87a64afa7","e74e9bfdebb2e9eb","76daeadc9ac4f409","f0b39f920854da20","e0bc79e14d83be0f"]}